  <Docs>
    <summary>A change log holds the <c>Metadata#getId()</c> of a deleted Record.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>A change log holds the <c>Metadata#getId()</c> of a deleted Record. For privacy, only unique
            identifiers of deleted records are returned.</para>
      <para>Clients holding copies of data from Health Connect should keep a copy of these unique
            identifiers along with their contents. When receiving a <c>DeletedLog</c> in <c>ChangeLogsResponse</c>, use the identifiers to delete copy of the data.</para>
      <para>
        <format type="text/html">
          <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/health/connect/changelog/ChangeLogsResponse.DeletedLog" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.health.connect.changelog.ChangeLogsResponse.DeletedLog</code>.</a>
        </format>
      </para>
      <para>
